{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Forte felt closest to my recent interest in The New Old Fashioned because an ensemble vocal album is what I want to try now.",
    "Partners and Cheek to Cheek appealed to my interest in vocal performances and familiar standards, even though I only wanted to choose one album."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Home for Christmas connects to my older holiday listening, but that does not mean I am looking for Christmas music now.",
    "The rock and country compilations did not connect to my current interest in vocal ensembles, and titles like The Definitive Collection and 16 Biggest Hits gave me too little information to judge a connection."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My several Christmas album interactions seem to have been treated as an ongoing holiday interest, although they happened together much earlier.",
    "The selection seems to stretch my interest in vocal music into a broader interest in familiar artists and greatest-hits albums than my choices support."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My most recent interaction, The New Old Fashioned, better reflects the vocal ensemble listening I want to continue now.",
    "An album can sound appealing without prompting me to choose it: I rarely interact, and Forte felt like the strongest match for my one choice today."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my interest in vocal performances but gave too much weight to older holiday listening and loosely related compilations."
}"}
